jobs.description:
Do you enjoy working with data, reporting and partner coordination, while playing a key role behind the success of a regional sales organization? Then this opportunity in Rijswijk could be the right next step for you. Please note: visa sponsorship is not available for this position.

What are you going to do?
We are looking for a Channel & Sales Operations Coordinator to support our regional sales and partner operations team. In this role, you will combine performance reporting, data management, partner support and event coordination in an international environment where Mandarin and English are used on a daily basis.

Your daily tasks include:

- Support the full lifecycle of channel partners, including onboarding, registration, qualification, and certification;
- Maintain accurate partner and performance data, with a strong focus on data processing, compliance, and record quality;
- Collect, consolidate, and update regional sales and channel information for internal reporting purposes;
- Prepare weekly and monthly reports and briefings for the regional team and headquarters;
- Monitor business reviews, project processes, and operational compliance across sales and channel activities;
- Coordinate customer invitation lists, RSVP tracking, and event logistics for regional marketing events and business initiatives;
- Work closely with sales, marketing, and other internal departments to ensure efficient execution of business processes;

What do we offer?
- A yearcontract to start with, salary between €3,200 and €4,000 gross per month, depending on your experience;
- 24 vacation days to support a healthy work-life balance;
- An attractive bonus scheme and salary increases every six months based on performance;
- Access to an on-site gym and a modern company restaurant offering both Western and Asian meals;
- A dynamic and international working environment at a leading technology company;
- The opportunity to grow within marketing and develop your partner manage

We’re looking for a reach truck operator who is skilled at driving this type of equipment for a dynamic organization in the Echt region. In this role, you’ll be responsible for handling incoming and outgoing goods using a reach truck. Does working in a clean, well-organized facility energize you? This permanent position offers you job security on the day shift!

Duties:

- Placing pallets of products on shelves using a single-deep or double-deep reach truck;
- Picking orders; 
- Assisting with loading containers; 
- Supporting all logistical tasks as they arise.

You’ll spend most of your time operating the reach truck, so it’s important that you have experience with this type of logistics vehicle. Do you see yourself in this role? Don’t hesitate—read on!

This is a day shift position from 6:00 AM to 3:00 PM, Monday through Friday. 

- Experience operating a reach truck and a certificate demonstrating that you possess the qualities of a good reach truck operator;
- You speak Dutch, English, or German.

SamenvattingDo you prefer working at night, staying active, and would you like to be part of one of the world's largest logistics companies? Then be sure to read on! Good Work!Over de functieAs a Warehouse Employee, you ensure that parcels are sorted and scanned. You are therefore an important link in the logistics process! This is an active job that involves a lot of walking and lifting.
- Loading and unloading parcels from trucks;
- Sorting parcels by destination and size;
- Scanning parcels and updating tracking systems;
- Reporting damaged or suspicious parcels.

This job is for 20–25 hours per week. The shifts are night shifts on weekdays.
Working hours:
You start between 2:00 AM and 3:00 AM and finish between 6:00 AM and 10:00 AM, usually around 8:00 AM.
Over het bedrijfYour new employer, DHL, is an indispensable link in the global logistics process. Parcels are sorted, shipped, and delivered in more than 200 countries.
Wat wij vragen- Own accomodation in The Netherlands;
- You speak basic Dutch or English;
- You are in good physical condition and able to lift heavy items;
- You are available to work night shifts.

Of course, these points are essential for the role of order picker, but we are primarily interested in who you are! Inspire us.
Wat wij bieden- A salary of €14,99 gross per hour;
- 130% allowance on top of your salary for working in the night;
- 150% allowance if you work overtime;
- 200% pay for working on public holidays;
- 8% holiday allowance;
- Opportunities for career growth and professional development.

